# Code owners.
#
# At solo scale this documents intent rather than gating anything -- GitHub
# only enforces it once branch protection requires review. It costs nothing to
# establish now and becomes load-bearing the moment a second person appears.
#
# The rows that matter are the last three. Files that change how every future
# Claude session behaves deserve the same scrutiny as source code, and they
# routinely get less because they look like documentation.
#
# See docs/strategy/07-tracking.md and docs/strategy/05-review-and-security.md.

# Default owner for everything not matched below.
*                       @madfoosa

# The example slices.
/examples/              @madfoosa

# Agent configuration. A hook is a shell script running with your permissions;
# a rule shapes every decision an agent makes in this repo.
/.claude/               @madfoosa
/CLAUDE.md              @madfoosa

# The machinery that verifies everything else. Changes here weaken or
# strengthen every other check, so they need the closest look.
/.github/workflows/     @madfoosa
/Makefile               @madfoosa
/scripts/               @madfoosa
